sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant StoreFront
    participant RemoteQuery as Remote Query
    participant PricingMod as Pricing Module
    participant PricingRepo as PricingRepositoryService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over StoreFront, DB: Price Calculation on Product Listing

    StoreFront->>RemoteQuery: GET /store/products?currency_code=usd&region_id=reg_01

    RemoteQuery->>RemoteQuery: Expand product variants<br/>Join variant→price_set via Module Link
    RemoteQuery->>PricingMod: calculatePrices(<br/>  filters: { id: [pset_01, pset_02, ...] },<br/>  context: { currency_code: "usd", region_id: "reg_01" }<br/>)

    PricingMod->>PricingRepo: calculatePrices(filters, context)

    PricingRepo->>DB: SELECT p.*, pl.*, pr.*<br/>FROM price p<br/>LEFT JOIN price_rule pr ON pr.price_id = p.id<br/>LEFT JOIN price_list pl ON pl.id = p.price_list_id<br/>WHERE p.price_set_id IN (filters.id)<br/>AND p.currency_code = 'usd'<br/>AND (pl.id IS NULL OR (pl.status = 'active'<br/>  AND now() BETWEEN pl.starts_at AND pl.ends_at))

    DB-->>PricingRepo: candidate rows

    PricingRepo->>PricingRepo: Evaluate PriceRules against context<br/>(region_id EQ reg_01, etc.)
    PricingRepo->>PricingRepo: Rank: rules_count DESC → list_type priority<br/>OVERRIDE > SALE > base price

    PricingRepo-->>PricingMod: CalculatedPriceSet[]
    PricingMod-->>RemoteQuery: CalculatedPriceSet[]

    RemoteQuery->>RemoteQuery: Merge calculated_price into<br/>each ProductVariantDTO

    RemoteQuery-->>StoreFront: ProductDTO[] with prices

    Note over StoreFront, DB: Add Prices to PriceSet (Admin)

    participant AdminAPI as Admin API
    participant Workflow as addPricesWorkflow

    AdminAPI->>Workflow: POST /admin/products/:id/variants/:v_id<br/>prices: [{ currency_code: "usd", amount: 9999 }]

    Workflow->>PricingMod: addPrices({ price_set_id: pset_01, prices: [...] })
    PricingMod->>DB: INSERT price (currency_code, amount, price_set_id)
    PricingMod->>DB: INSERT price_rule (if rules provided)
    PricingMod->>DB: UPDATE price.rules_count = rule_count
    DB-->>PricingMod: ok
    PricingMod-->>Workflow: PriceSetDTO
    Workflow-->>AdminAPI: updated variant with prices
